WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-03 - Painted Smile
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:53.000
[Instrumental Intro: Gentle 80s Power Ballad]

00:00:53.551 --> 00:01:01.955
Just one more day, just one more night

00:01:02.035 --> 00:01:09.500
Safe in this warm and gentle light

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:15.500
With you beside me, I can breathe

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.036
A quiet promise, I believe

00:01:21.376 --> 00:01:28.500
This is my home, this is my peace

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:35.500
A fragile, temporary lease

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:41.500
On who I am, on who I'll be

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.267
Before the shadows come for me

00:01:46.500 --> 00:02:15.800
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:16.117 --> 00:02:23.500
An easy laugh, a gentle sound

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:29.500
On this familiar, sacred ground

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:35.347
No need to guess, no need to hide

00:02:36.608 --> 00:02:44.500
With my true north right by my side

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:50.500
A steady hand, a knowing glance

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.816
A world away from happenstance

00:02:56.797 --> 00:03:02.500
This is the truth I'm clinging to

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:09.890
My sanctuary here with you

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:19.500
But I hear your footsteps in the hall

00:03:20.236 --> 00:03:25.000
I see your shadow on the wall

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:30.500
The air gets thick, the silence screams

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:36.849
The end of all my fragile dreams

00:03:44.568 --> 00:03:52.500
My heart begins to beat the drum

00:03:52.600 --> 00:04:01.762
For the cold and silent man I must become

00:04:05.709 --> 00:04:09.500
And now the mask comes down

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.200
Just a face in a lonely town

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:16.034
The painted smile is in its place

00:04:16.154 --> 00:04:19.800
Leaving not a single trace

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.200
Of the boy I was a breath ago

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.800
A secret no one else can know

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.800
The static's on, the silence starts

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:32.443
Protecting all my broken parts

00:04:38.615 --> 00:04:45.601
The painted smile...

00:04:45.621 --> 00:04:49.500
The static's on...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.800
Can't let her see...

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:56.800
The fear in me...

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:03.915
The silence starts...

00:05:03.996 --> 00:05:08.500
The silence starts...

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:23.000
[Industrial Outro]
